WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
A One-on-One Fight Between Men!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Masaru VS Suguru

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:08.070
A One-on-One Fight Between Men!

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.550
Masaru VS Suguru!

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.970
In order to make certain of the God of the Digital World's, his father Suguru's, true feelings,

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.870
Masaru and Agumon continued their journey.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.390
One of the Royal Knights, Craniummon, blocked their path.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.990
Faced with Craniummon's shield, which boasted of an absolute defense,

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.940
Masaru and ShineGreymon were at their wits' end.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:37.100
But with the arrival of Tohma, Yoshino, and Ikuto, the shield was shattered,

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.200
and Craniummon allowed them to pass.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.370
Everything... should have been thrown away...

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:00.800
Why are the memories returning now?

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.630
It can't be...

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:08.560
Intruders?

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:12.040
So Craniummon has forsaken me.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:15.490
But that calculation error can still be corrected.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:21.250
Remove all... who dare to interfere with my plans!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:53.930
When you see it up close, it looks gigantic!

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:54.990
Of course.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:59.970
This tree is where the God of the Digital World, Yggdrasil, is said to live.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.970
Normally, I'd be terrified to approach it this close.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.260
Dad is at the top of this tree...

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.890
Are we really going to climb this?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.440
Of course!

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.400
Let's go, Agumon!

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.380
Yeah!

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:17.520
Always a character.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.350
Wait, Masaru!

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:21.650
Gaomon.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:22.570
Yes, Master.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:24.360
Double Backhand!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.730
Oww...

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.680
What was that for, Tohma?

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.540
Aniki.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.500
It's shining.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.720
These are optical cables, aren't they?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.710
Just as I'd thought.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:42.670
This tree must be the main server that administers the Digital World.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.510
Aniki.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.250
What's a "server?"

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:49.550
It's that tasty thing you boil with miso sauce.

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.350
That's a "saba."

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.350
NOTE: <i>Saba</i> (鯖) is mackerel.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:55.350
A server is an electronic brain that controls tons of information.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.820
The God, Yggdrasil, controls everything in the Digital World...

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:04.780
Since we humans don't act as he pleases, we must appear like a virus to him.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.230
Masaru!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.500
It looks like we can go in here!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.240
Master.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.190
Something is coming.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:20.500
What are they?

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.540
Look out!

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.540
Master!

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:28.870
This is...

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.400
Do they work for Yggdrasil?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.190
It may be more accurate to call them this tree's security system!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.180
Baby Flame!

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:44.600
Agumon!

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.390
Let's go.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.900
Nuts Shoot!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.250
Shuririnken!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:01.780
Lalamon!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.920
Falcomon!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:05.460
Falcomon!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.510
Lalamon, hang in there!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:09.690
The two of us will hold them back!

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.370
You guys go ahead!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.580
Tohma, we're counting on you!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.360
Hurry!

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:15.820
Hurry, Masaru!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:16.560
Yeah!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.740
Tohma!

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:20.020
Don't push yourself.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:24.570
Who do you think I am?

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.700
Let's show them our hidden power.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.700
Yes, Master.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.010
Digisoul Charge!

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.260
Overdrive!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.460
Gaomon, evolve!

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.190
MirageGaogamon!

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:02.610
Yggdrasil is up here!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.740
It's kinda small in here, isn't it?

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.550
It's just right for me.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.320
Maybe for you...

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:12.940
Change places!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.290
What's up with you?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.570
They're here again!

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:19.540
Damn it!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:21.500
You bastards...

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.290
are in the way!

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:28.550
What?

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.300
Let's go, Agumon!

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:31.800
Yeah!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.640
Digisoul Cha-

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.720
Wait just a minute!

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.570
What are you doing?

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.650
If you evolve here...

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.350
There won't be any space left to move around!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.650
Oh... right.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.340
Anyway, let's hide for the time being!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.000
Damn it...

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.060
Masaru!

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:05.020
Masaru, it looks like there's a path up there!

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.340
What the hell.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.590
There was a path right in front of us.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.510
Looks that way, Aniki.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:18.480
We'll take care of these guys!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.520
Go ahead of us, Masaru!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.480
You know I can't do that!

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:26.480
You're the only one who can stop your father, Masaru!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:28.710
Ikuto...

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.590
Musashiya's strawberry mille-feuille and Yokonami's coffee jelly.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:33.410
Huh?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.400
Buy me those later and we'll call it even.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.680
But remember to keep this in mind:

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:45.380
Even if we defeat Professor Daimon, we still need to figure out how to stop the collision.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:47.380
Yoshino...

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.160
Let's go, Ikuto!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.020
Yeah!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.050
What...

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.810
What devoted friendship!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:57.670
I feel so inspired!

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.640
Aniki!

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:02.680
Don't look back!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:03.390
Climb!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.780
Digisoul Charge!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.780
Digisoul Charge!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.220
Overdrive!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.220
Overdrive!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.450
Lalamon, evolve!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:14.950
Falcomon, evolve!

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:29.340
Rosemon!

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.390
Ravemon!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:42.060
Let our fangs sharpen!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.020
Let the flowers of life bloom!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.610
We won't let you take another step ahead!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.610
We won't let you take another step ahead!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.400
Tohma.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.170
Yoshino.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.050
Ikuto.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.460
Don't any of you dare die on me!

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.960
What's the status update, Professor Noguchi?

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:05.930
Have you found a way to repair the dimensional barrier?

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:09.210
I've only now accessed the data of the space-time oscillation bombs.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.910
If I can understand the principles behind how they destroyed the barrier,

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.950
I may be able to figure out how to repair it as well.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.170
Please do.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:20.730
If we can circumvent the collision between the human world and the Digital World,

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:23.890
I'm sure it will convince Professor Daimon to change his way of thinking.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:27.230
Captain.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.420
There's a Digimon signal in the harbor district.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.720
It's a Royal Knight.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.560
What?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.330
Another Digimon has come to attack.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.500
Mom.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.230
Run away, everyone!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.180
Piyomon!

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.170
What are you planning on doing?

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:02.640
You can't be...

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.560
Piyomon!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:12.900
Wait!

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.320
This is the human's world!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.240
Get out right now!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.790
{onkei: Flapping straight with one wing God I love Digimon xD} {Splash: omg XD}

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:23.240
Are you another Digimon who supports the humans?

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:24.650
That's right!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.080
If you won't leave...

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.800
I'll fight you!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.520
I don't have time for this right now.

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.850
Piyomon!

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:47.420
Piyomon!

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:48.390
Hang in there!

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:51.770
I'm okay...

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:54.360
I can... still fight...

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:56.220
You can't, Piyomon!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.070
You'll die!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.280
I won't die!

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:02.390
I promised...

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.530
I promised I'd protect you!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.040
Piyomon!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:11.980
Besides...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.210
If I give up just from this,

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.170
my manliness will rot!

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.060
Piyomon!

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.140
Okay then!

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:28.600
In that case... I'll fight with you!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:29.730
Chika.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:36.190
Chika!

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.150
You can't!

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:47.660
CHIKA!

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.460
This light...

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.430
Chika...

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.430
Is this the power that human has given you?

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.100
Now, bring it!

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.460
We'll take you on!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:24.360
Dad, you're there, aren't you?

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:29.450
Your son, Daimon Masaru, is here to have a good talk with you.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.330
This is God's dwelling.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.860
It's not a place for the likes of you to step in.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:42.680
Dad!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.680
Explain to me why you want to destroy the human world!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.410
I have a duty to protect the Digital World.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.310
Erasing the human world is only a natural outcome.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.620
Then...

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.770
What about Mom?!

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:55.880
And Chika?!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.980
Don't you care about what happens to them?!

00:12:58.650 --> 00:12:59.980
Have you forgotten?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:05.150
It was you humans who brought this calamity on yourselves.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.260
But Dad...

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.070
But Dad...!

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:11.190
You're human, too!

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:13.380
Don't talk nonsense.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:14.870
I am God.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:21.690
Dad...

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.550
Dad... have you really changed?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.420
<i>Wow!</i>

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.390
<i>Masaru.</i>

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:39.010
<i>This pendant...</i>

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.150
<i>is proof of a grown man.</i>

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.350
<i>A grown man?</i>

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.100
In that case...

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.290
I'll...

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.410
I'll...

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.120
I'll just have to

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.000
open your eyes!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.730
I've already told you,

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.360
I am God.

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:03.150
What?!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.160
ANIKI!

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:14.830
Aniki!

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:16.080
Aniki!

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:19.010
Damn it...

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:23.310
I can't even get close enough... for us to talk with our fists!

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.070
Aniki...

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.190
Damn it...

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:29.340
Damn it...!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.520
DAMN IT!!!

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.270
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:41.790
What?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:45.310
Don't rely on your attacks!

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:47.300
Use physical blows!

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:49.300
Yes, Master!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:58.800
That's it!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:14:59.730
Keep it up!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:07.650
Look out!

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:17.700
Ravemon!

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.160
Thorn Whip!

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:24.700
Behind you!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:26.600
Rosemon!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.380
You...!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:32.680
Thank you.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:34.830
We'll never lose!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:35.820
That's right.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:39.220
We've gotten over plenty of situations like this before!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.020
Shadow Wing!

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.490
Sorry, but I have no time to be playing with you.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.020
What?!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.500
Damn it...

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.360
Wait!

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:16.290
You wish to save the human world even if it means cutting short your own life...

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:16.290
{onkei: Being a banchou means having drums pound whenever you make an appearance... naruhodo...}

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.510
What a fool you are.

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.430
Stop!

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:21.570
Stay away from BanchouLeomon!

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.970
My friend's life is draining away.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.190
I cannot stand by and watch him die.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.280
Aniki!

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.760
Stay back!

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:46.570
This fight is between me and Dad!

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:48.670
Even if my arms break off,

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.710
I'll never give up until I've exchanged fists with him!

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:54.130
Aniki...

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:55.880
Aniki!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.430
I'm telling you it's pointless.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:04.520
Impossible!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.830
It's impossible!

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.250
You're up against the God of the Digital World!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.610
You can't win against him!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.230
I know...

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.570
I know that!

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:19.190
My Dad's back is big and warm.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:23.980
When you're a kid, you can't out-distance your father's back.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:27.710
But I wanted to reach it and get close to it!

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.170
As close as I could!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.430
That's why...

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.950
That's why...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:38.140
I've always done my best!

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:40.390
You're an eyesore.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.300
I believed in you...

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.360
Dad...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.320
Masaru!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:57.800
Mom...

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:58.700
Chika...

00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.660
I'm sorry...

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.330
My fists couldn't reach him...

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:03.560
Masaru!

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:05.280
Tohma...

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.170
Yoshino...

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.310
Ikuto...

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.740
I failed.

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.790
I wasn't even a match for him.

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.250
Masaru!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:15.300
Am I... going to die?

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.470
ANIKI!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.450
Agumon...

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:23.060
Don't give up.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.470
This voice...

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.070
I've already told you.

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:29.030
The Digisoul is the power of your emotions.

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:31.350
The power of... my emotions...?

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:35.410
The power of emotions will give anyone infinite potential.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.360
Burn your Digisoul!

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:40.730
Burn those passionate feelings within you until they explode!

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.080
That light...!

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.050
MirageGaogamon!

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:49.040
Shoot at Masaru!

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.790
But, Master...!

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.350
Do it now!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.930
<b>kizutsuita hane ga</b>

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.930
<b>My injured wings</b>

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.940
Full Moon Blaster!

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:57.210
<b>kiseki wo yobiokoshite</b>

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:57.210
<b>Will awaken a miracle</b>

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:01.050
<b>futatabi mau yo</b>

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:01.050
<b>And I will flutter once again</b>

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:02.090
Masaru!

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:03.450
<b>yume no kaze ni nori</b>

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:03.450
<b>Riding on the wind of dreams</b>

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.940
<b>kirameku niji wo koete</b>

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.940
<b>And surpassing the glittering rainbow</b>

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.260
Forbidden Temptation!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:10.470
<b>tabi no tsuzuki e</b>

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:10.470
<b>I continue on towards my journey</b>

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.980
Go, Masaru!

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:13.460
<b>sora wo miagete saa!</b>

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:13.460
<b>Now, look up at the sky!</b>

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.070
Your feelings...

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:15.070
Send them to your father!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.230
<b>michi naru sono tobira hirake!</b>

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.230
<b>Break open that unknown door!</b>

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.230
That's right!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:20.460
This isn't just between me and my dad anymore.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.320
<b>mirai e in the sky</b>

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.320
<b>Towards my future in the sky</b>

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.530
<b>kanjita mama ni</b>

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.530
<b>Just as I felt it</b>

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:24.290
My friends who believe in me and push me forward are with me!

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:25.070
<b>shinjita! it’s my soul</b>

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:25.070
<b>I believed in it! It's my soul</b>

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:27.240
I have to stand firm and face him for their sakes, too!

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.490
<b>dokomademo yuku yo</b>

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.490
<b>It'll take me anywhere</b>

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.920
<b>michibike! in the sky</b>

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.920
<b>Guide me in the sky</b>

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:32.140
<b>minna wo tsurete</b>

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:32.140
<b>Bringing everyone along</b>

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:32.580
What?!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.680
<b>shinjita! it’s my soul</b>

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.680
<b>I believed in it! It's my soul</b>

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:38.210
<b>hirari mai agaru</b>

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:38.210
<b>Nimbly I will soar above</b>

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:50.610
I don't believe it!

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:51.520
Aniki!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.480
I heard my dad's voice!

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.080
Your dad's?

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.590
I'm sure of it.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:01.190
Dad hasn't completely forgotten about us.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.690
I'm sure that deep inside...

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:06.660
he still remembers the past we shared together!

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:08.670
But... why?

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:13.140
Dad never told me about the Digisoul...

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.130
Unforgivable.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:23.450
How dare you harm the body of the God of the Digital World!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:26.590
Now... I can no longer forgive you!

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:28.030
Dad...

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.770
Dad...

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.060
My fist didn't reach him...?!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.390
This is the end.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.290
Wait!

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:59.840
BanchouLeomon!

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.130
Why are you here?

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:05.800
Craniummon took over in my place.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:07.750
Craniummon?

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.180
Yes.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.970
That guy is now fighting all on his own

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:16.190
to save both the human world and the Digital World.

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:19.500
Dad!

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.290
You can't go!

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:24.300
Do you still not understand?!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.420
That is your father...

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:27.660
but at the same time, he is not!

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:31.430
Your father, Daimon Suguru...

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:33.230
is me!

